{"id":4220,"date":"2023-06-21T08:42:39","date_gmt":"2023-06-21T08:42:39","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.swat4ls.org\/?page_id=4220"},"modified":"2024-02-18T19:48:05","modified_gmt":"2024-02-18T19:48:05","slug":"registration","status":"publish","type":"page","link":"https:\/\/www.swat4ls.org\/workshops\/leiden2024\/registration\/","title":{"rendered":"Register to SWAT4HCLS"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong> <\/strong><br>Registration is open! <a href=\"https:\/\/register.oxfordabstracts.com\/event\/4806\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>Register here to SWAT4HCLS 2024<\/strong><\/a>. <br>You will need to create an account, please use your affiliation\/work email.   <br>Payment by bank transfer is available on request. The registration remains open until the conference day. <br>To help smoother organisation please register as soon as possible*.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Registration fees<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Fees include catering and social dinner (as per program) as well as VAT. <br>All prices are in Euro (EUR). 100EUR is roughly 107 USD (see <a href=\"https:\/\/www.x-rates.com\/table\/?from=EUR&amp;amount=1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">current exchange rates<\/a>).<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-table\"><table><tbody><tr><td><\/td><td><strong>Academic<\/strong> (including startups)<\/td><td><strong>Industry<\/strong><\/td><td><strong>Students<\/strong><\/td><\/tr><tr><td><strong>Tutorial day<\/strong><\/td><td>130<\/td><td>190<\/td><td>85<\/td><\/tr><tr><td><strong>Main Conference days<\/strong><\/td><td>410<\/td><td>580<\/td><td>280<\/td><\/tr><tr><td><strong>Hackathon day<\/strong><\/td><td>50<\/td><td>70<\/td><td>35<\/td><\/tr><tr><td><strong>Virtual attendance<\/strong><br>(live stream of Tutorial &amp; Conference Days)<\/td><td>180<\/td><td>180<\/td><td>180<\/td><\/tr><\/tbody><\/table><figcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\"><em>All fees are expressed in EUR, VAT included<\/em><\/figcaption><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Limited places<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Places at SWAT4HCLS are limited. While provisions are made for presenters of accepted papers, all other entries should be considered as allocated on a first come\/first served basis.&nbsp;We encourage early registrations! <\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-small-font-size wp-block-paragraph\">*) Registration is always is possible, even on site, but we need time for the logistics. <br>We cannot <em>guarantee<\/em> access to all conference options, such as the conference dinner, after February 12.<\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Registration is open! Register here to SWAT4HCLS 2024. You will need to create an account, please use your affiliation\/work email. Payment by bank transfer is available on request. The registration remains open until the conference day. To help smoother organisation &hellip; <a href=\"https:\/\/www.swat4ls.org\/workshops\/leiden2024\/registration\/\">Continue reading <span class=\"meta-nav\">&rarr;<\/span><\/a><\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":4280,"parent":4207,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"footnotes":""},"class_list":["post-4220","page","type-page","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry"],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.swat4ls.org\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages\/4220","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.swat4ls.org\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.swat4ls.org\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/page"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.swat4ls.org\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/1"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.swat4ls.org\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=4220"}],"version-history":[{"count":17,"href":"https:\/\/www.swat4ls.org\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages\/4220\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":4690,"href